    "enUS": {
      "description": "This vial that you picked up from the Winterfall furbolg is empty, but you can detect a few drops of a strange green liquid inside; it almost glows.\n\nIs it something important?\n\nDonova Snowden would probably be able to tell you more, since she has been camped by the hot springs in Winterspring for some time now.",
      "dialogue": {
        "560c6523d403d413f16f": "What is that you have found?",
        "b97f227a0c3ed5318eb7": "You got this from the Winterfall?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Empty Firewater Flask to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",
      "title": "Winterfall Firewater",
